// ==========================================================================
// _MaxDateInFilter
// Model folder: 10 - Parameters & Helpers / 10.1 - Date & Period
// --------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Purpose: Latest date in context.
// Why it exists: Anchors as-of logic. Note the model-wide caveat: several
// measures anchor to the calendar max rather than the max fact date, which
// is why dim_date is pinned to the data horizon.
// ==========================================================================

MAX(dim_date[Date])
